# The UX8407AA main panel is physically mounted upside down. Its RAYD0001
# touchscreen reports the panel's native coordinates, while GNOME rotates the
# eDP-1 output by 180 degrees. Apply the inverse transform at libinput so a
# touch at a physical corner reaches the same visible corner.
#
# Matrix form: x' = -x + 1, y' = -y + 1
ACTION=="add|change", SUBSYSTEM=="input", KERNEL=="event*", ATTRS{id/vendor}=="2386", ATTRS{id/product}=="8c05", ENV{ID_INPUT_TOUCHSCREEN}=="1", ENV{LIBINPUT_CALIBRATION_MATRIX}="-1 0 1 0 -1 1"
